        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Georgia, southeastern United States\n- Organizations: ANAK Society, Georgia World Congress Center Authority\n- Buildings: Georgia World Congress Center, Georgia Dome\n- Events: Southeastern Flower Show\n\nFacts:\n- The ANAK Society is based in Georgia's city of Atlanta.\n- The Georgia Dome was a domed stadium in the southeastern United States located in Atlanta, Georgia.\n- The Georgia Dome was recently retired.\n- The Georgia World Congress Center Authority developed the Georgia Dome.\n- The Georgia World Congress Center Authority also developed the Georgia World Congress Center.\n- The Georgia World Congress Center is home to the Southeastern Flower Show.",
