        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "04005047-59b9-5f4c-887d-0efa302f71e2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Atlanta, Georgia, USA\n- Organizations: Georgia World Congress Center Authority, ANAK Society, Georgia Institute of Technology\n- Venues: Georgia World Congress Center, Georgia Dome, Mercedes-Benz Stadium\n- Events: Southeastern Flower Show\n- Projects: Centennial Olympic Park\n\nFacts:\n- The Georgia World Congress Center is a convention center in Atlanta, Georgia, USA.\n- The Georgia World Congress Center Authority later developed the Georgia Dome, Centennial Olympic Park, and Mercedes-Benz Stadium.\n- Mercedes-Benz Stadium replaced the Georgia Dome.\n- The Georgia Dome was a domed stadium in the southeastern United States and was under demolition after its retirement.\n- The Georgia Dome was located in Atlanta, Georgia, between downtown on the east and Vine City on the west.\n- The State of Georgia owned and operated the Georgia Dome as part of the Georgia World Congress Center Authority.\n- The Southeastern Flower Show is held in early spring in Atlanta, Georgia at the Georgia World Congress Center.\n- The ANAK Society is the oldest known secret society and honor society at the Georgia Institute of Technology in Atlanta, Georgia, United States.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "84ba33b3-a11a-5a1f-ab29-72196047f116",
        "text": "Page: Georgia World Congress Center. Sentence: The Georgia World Congress Center (GWCC) is a convention center in Atlanta, Georgia, USA.\nPage: Georgia World Congress Center. Sentence: The authority later developed the Georgia Dome, Centennial Olympic Park, and Mercedes-Benz Stadium, which replaced the Georgia Dome.\nPage: Georgia Dome. Sentence: The Georgia Dome is a recently retired domed stadium in the southeastern United States, currently under demolition.\nPage: Georgia Dome. Sentence: Located in Atlanta, Georgia, between downtown to the east and Vine City to the west, it was owned and operated by the State of Georgia as part of the Georgia World Congress Center Authority.\nPage: Southeastern Flower Show. Sentence: The show is held in early spring in Atlanta, Georgia at the Georgia World Congress Center.\nPage: ANAK Society. Sentence: The ANAK Society is the oldest known secret society and honor society at the Georgia Institute of Technology (Georgia Tech) in Atlanta, Georgia, United States.",
